      <title>Green notification for tropical cyclone XAVIER-26. Population affected by Category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0  (0 in Tropical Storm).</title>
      <description>From 15/11/2026 to 22/11/2026, a Tropical Storm (maximum wind speed of 241 km/h) XAVIER-26 was active in SEPacific. The cyclone affects these countries: Cook Islands, American Samoa (vulnerability Medium). Estimated population affected by category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0  (0 in tropical storm).</description>
